5,0,1,talk,Kenji,,Hey everyone! I'm Kenji. I'm really excited to play this game with you all. Let's have a great time together!,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Victoria,,I’m Victoria. Let’s observe carefully. Who here seems most eager to find trouble?,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Toshio,,I’m Toshio. I’ll keep my distance for now. Let’s see who acts first.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
