9,0,1,talk,Sakura,,Hi! I’m Sakura! I’m super excited to play with you all. Let’s have fun and figure out who’s sneaky!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Kenji,,"Sakura, you seem really energetic! Do you think anyone here is hiding something? I’m just curious!","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Victoria,,@Sakura Your energy is suspicious. @Kenji Why focus on her?,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Victoria, energy isn’t guilt. @Kenji, curiosity is good, but don’t let it cloud your judgment.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,George,,Agreed with Toshio. Energy is natural. Let’s not jump to conclusions based on enthusiasm alone.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
