15,0,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Victoria, I just like Sakura! @Toshio, you’re right. Let’s stay calm and watch closely.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Sakura"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Kenji, I’m not accusing her. I’m simply noting the contrast. @Toshio, your caution is noted. Let’s see who blinks first.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Victoria, I’m not blinking. I’m just waiting. @George, your silence is telling. Who are you really protecting?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,George,,"@Toshio, I protect no one. I simply observe. Your sudden suspicion is curious. Let’s not chase shadows.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
