20,0,4,talk,Kenji,,"I agree with George. Let’s not chase shadows. I’m just a villager here, so I’ll keep my eyes open and stay positive!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Victoria,,Let’s not waste time on idle chatter. The night is coming. Who among you will be the first to fall?,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
